stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scheduled: generated from the investment's schedule
    Scheduled --> Confirmed: bank SIP debit or fund-house allotment\nmatches (amount + account + date window + text)
    Scheduled --> Failed: failed-debit message matches this instalment
    Scheduled --> Missed: no match by due date + grace days
    Missed --> Confirmed: late debit / allotment arrives
    Failed --> Confirmed: retry debit succeeds
    Scheduled --> MarkedPaid: you mark it paid
    Scheduled --> Skipped: you skip it
    Missed --> MarkedPaid: you mark it paid
    Missed --> Skipped: you skip it
    Confirmed --> [*]
    MarkedPaid --> [*]
    Skipped --> [*]
    note right of Scheduled
        Two SIPs could match the same message?
        Nothing changes: a review item asks you.
        Any status you set is stored as a
        user_override and survives rebuilds.
    end note
